export async function loadBoardingProof(stayId:string,customer=false){return read<BoardingProofSnapshot>(await fetch(`/api/boarding-proof?${customer?"scope=customer&":""}stayId=${encodeURIComponent(stayId)}`,{cache:"no-store"}));}
export async function updateBoardingProof(input:{stayId:string;action:BoardingProofAction;idempotencyKey:string;purpose?:"boarding_checkin"|"stay_update"|"boarding_medication"|"boarding_incident"|"boarding_checkout";mimeType?:string;sizeBytes?:number;sha256?:string;uploadToken?:string;storageObjectId?:string;mediaRef?:string;scanResult?:"clean"|"rejected";reason?:string;note?:string;medicationName?:string;dose?:string;administeredAt?:string;incidentId?:string;severity?:"attention"|"urgent"|"emergency";summary?:string;actionTaken?:string;resolution?:string}){return read<Record<string,unknown>>(await fetch("/api/boarding-proof",{method:"POST",headers:{"content-type":"application/json"},body:JSON.stringify(input)}));}
