  // 0 < limit and both issued a reward: Rs 1,000 released against a Rs 500 configured monthly ceiling.
  // The per-claim guards (claim_id UNIQUE, source_booking_id UNIQUE) stop the same claim being rewarded
  // twice but say nothing about the cross-claim cap, which is the only thing bounding reward farming.
  // Written the way lib/coupon-governance.ts already enforces its own ceiling: the subquery yields NULL
